WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,900
If you are not tired, just treat it as losing weight.

2
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:04,420
You still have to work hard to cut down trees and upgrade your wooden house.

3
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:06,300
The cold wave is coming in eighteen days

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,140
We have to prepare resources quickly.

5
00:00:08,140 --> 00:00:10,860
Remaining daytime, four hours

6
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:14,340
Only four hours left

7
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:15,620
Let's cut for another hour

8
00:00:15,620 --> 00:00:16,740
I'll go cook

9
00:00:16,740 --> 00:00:19,300
Today I will fry some small horse fish. You can eat it.

10
00:00:19,300 --> 00:00:20,540
That's great

11
00:00:20,540 --> 00:00:24,010
This fish was caught from the river

12
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:25,210
Well, that's right

13
00:00:25,210 --> 00:00:26,930
Walk downstream for about a mile

14
00:00:26,930 --> 00:00:28,050
There is a shoal

15
00:00:28,050 --> 00:00:29,650
There’s not just little marlin in it

16
00:00:29,650 --> 00:00:31,490
There are still a lot of small shrimps. You should cook them first.

17
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:32,450
Let's go over and have a look

18
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:34,810
Let's see if we can get some more, bro.

19
00:00:34,810 --> 00:00:35,890
Do you have the tools?

20
00:00:35,890 --> 00:00:37,490
We all caught it with our bare hands

21
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:39,410
In so many days, we caught more than thirty fish.

22
00:00:39,410 --> 00:00:40,410
Very hard to catch

23
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,160
Can you catch it with bare hands?

24
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:45,280
We took big rocks and threw them into the water.

25
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:46,840
Hit him unconscious and then catch him

26
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:47,800
don't worry

27
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:53,860
We will find a way

28
00:00:53,860 --> 00:00:55,620
Does anyone know a craftsman?

29
00:00:55,620 --> 00:00:57,900
He is the one who weaves tools with bamboo honey

30
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,380
Bamboo honey weaving tools

31
00:00:59,380 --> 00:01:00,300
I can
